{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_cli_exception", "label": "The Deliberate CLI Exception", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pins and export/import have no COM API at any WinGet contract version (verified against the winget-cli IDL), so they are the library's single deliberate exception to 'no CLI' \u2014 shelling winget.exe behind the isolated IWinGetCliClient interface and re-exposed through IPackageManagementService."}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_pin_kinds", "label": "Pin Kinds (Pinning, Gating, Blocking)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pinning excludes a package from bulk upgrade-all but allows explicit upgrade; gating limits upgrades to a version pattern; blocking forbids upgrade entirely until removed."}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_getpins", "label": "GetPins", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_pin", "label": "Pin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_unpin", "label": "Unpin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_export", "label": "Export", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Snapshots installed packages to a winget import-compatible JSON file; a non-zero exit still yields a valid partial file, so existence of the file is the better success signal."}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_import", "label": "Import", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ignoreUnavailable skips packages no longer in any source; ignoreVersions=false honors the exported versions."}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_clioperationresult", "label": "CliOperationResult", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Since there is no structured COM result for CLI-backed operations, it captures the process outcome directly: Succeeded (ExitCode == 0), raw and hex exit codes matching APPINSTALLER_CLI_ERROR_* HRESULTs, and captured stdout/stderr."}, {"id": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_winget_exe_resolution", "label": "winget.exe Location Strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolves the per-user App Execution Alias first, then globs the WindowsApps package directory picking the highest version \u2014 the same strategy Winget-AutoUpdate uses \u2014 because service/SYSTEM contexts have no App Execution Alias. If neither works, WinGetUnavailableException is thrown."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_cli_exception", "target": "docs_getting_started_iwingetcliclient", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/usage/pins-export-import.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1